		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_041"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>べんきょうで　つかれた　ときには
ポケモンしょうぶに　かぎるよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T05:40:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>勉強で　疲れた時には
ポケモン勝負に　かぎるよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T05:44:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>じゅくがえり 男 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_042"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ウウーッ！　まよったー！
どこから　すすめばいいんだ！▼
……なんだい　キミは　このボクより
さきに　いこう　っていうの！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T10:35:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ウウーッ！　迷ったー！
どこから　進めばいいんだー！▼
……なんだい　キミは　このボクより
先に　行こうって言うの！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-05T09:38:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>じゅくがえり 男 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_043"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>にがてかもくは　さんすう！
とくいかもくは　ポケモンしょうぶ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T06:02:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>苦手科目は　算数！
得意科目は　ポケモン勝負！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T06:03:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>じゅくがえり 男 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_044"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もうっ！
わたしは　りっぱな　レディーなの！▼
こどもあつかい　したら
しょうちしないから！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-05T02:26:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もうっ！
わたしは　立派な　レディーなの！▼
子ども扱いしたら
承知しないから！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-05T02:26:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>じゅくがえり 女 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_045"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いつだって　テストは　１００てん！
えがおも　キラリ！▼
スーパーてんさいしょうじょ　とは
わたしのことよ！　しょうぶっ！▼　</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T06:20:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いつだって　テストは　１００点！
笑顔も　キラリ！▼
スーパー天才少女とは
わたしのことよ！　勝負っ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T06:20:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>じゅくがえり 女 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_046"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いえに　かえると　ママは　いっつも
べんきょう　しろって　うるさいの▼
だからね　ここに　いきぬきに
きてるんだ！　あそぼうよっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T06:32:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>家に帰ると　ママは　いっつも
勉強しろって　うるさいの▼
だからね　ここに　息抜きに
来てるんだ！　遊ぼうよっ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-04T06:33:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>じゅくがえり 女 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_047"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ！
こちらで　たいせんを　どうぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いらっしゃいませ！
こちらで　対戦を　どうぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ウエーター 男 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
