	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_BATTLE_START_MSG_TRID_102"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ボクは　せんしだ！　つよいんだ！
じゅけんせんそうに　しょうりするぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-05T10:19:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ボクは　戦士だ！　強いんだ！
受験戦争に　勝利するぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-05T10:19:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>じゅくがえり 男 b</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
